  "notes": [
    "DRAFT: hand-corrected from the map-815 spawn census (2026-10-24 prep). Positions are exact `creature` spawn rows. The draft's critter groups are gone (Rat 4075, Raven 61643: faction 31, flags_extra 2, 8 hp, civilian, not a party's trash), the linked spawns fight in one pull, the same-pack neighbours within the 8 yd pull surface are one pull with the radius stopped at the pack, and the boss guards are the bosses' `first` lists. Still not mapped and not live-checked: the GM mapping walk is to do (see the prep note's mapping-walk items).",
    "Gilneas City is a Turtle custom instance (map 815, instance script `instance_gilneas_city`). On aggro the instance calls `SetInCombatWithZone` for the creature that entered combat, so every fight is zone-wide for the party: running away does not drop combat.",
    "No door, key, lever or gossip gate exists on map 815 (only chests, chairs and doodads): no use_object step, no locked door.",
    "Harlow family chest (2020027, at -968.23 2959.41 166.31): spawned with the instance and respawned for an hour when Regent-Lady Celia Harlow (61263) dies; the plan has no loot step for it (bonus loot, not a gate).",
    "Genn Greymane (61418, level 49, 17280 hp) uses the `genn_greymane` script: Drain Life 17620, Mortal Strike 21551, Curse of Agony 11711, and a Fear 22678 on a random player below 50 % (not an event). Scripted trash: Greymane Knight 61365 (Strike 18368, Hammer of Justice 853) and Greymane Noble 61390 (Mind Blast 10945, Mind Flay 17312).",
    "Level band 43-49 (the draft's 42-47 did not cover the 47-48 Justicars or the 49 final boss). Highest trash level 48 (Greymane Justicar), bosses 44-49.",
    "The two Gilneas Stable Horses (61604) are aggro-linked (`creature_linking` flag 3) 19 yd apart: they are two pulls, so the first brings the second; a single pull would need a 19 yd radius that reaches the Knights and Levvin beside them."
  ],
